---
// Cta — recruitment terminal, styled as an RTS build order confirmation
---

<section id="cta">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="panel panel--riveted cta">
      <div class="panel__bar">
        <span>建造许可申请 · BUILD PERMIT</span>
        <span class="led" data-c="power" />
      </div>
      <div class="cta__body">
        <div class="cta__copy">
          <span class="eyebrow">内测招募</span>
          <h2 class="cta__title">申请一块厂区，开始建造你的智能体产线</h2>
          <p class="cta__sub">
            首批内测席位有限，优先开放给有真实多智能体工作流需求的团队。
            留下邮箱，我们会随开服批次逐轮发出建造许可。
          </p>
          <ul class="cta__list">
            <li>7 类预制厂房模板，开箱即用</li>
            <li>完整 token 流向可视化与成本预算控制</li>
            <li>技能卡系统，按需解锁 Agent 能力</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <form class="cta__form" method="post" action="#" novalidate>
          <label class="cta__field">
            <span class="cta__label">指挥官邮箱</span>
            <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="commander@base.io" />
          </label>
          <label class="cta__field">
            <span class="cta__label">团队规模</span>
            <select name="size">
              <option>1 人 · 独立开发</option>
              <option>2–10 人 · 小队</option>
              <option>11–50 人 · 中型团队</option>
              <option>50 人以上 · 企业</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <button type="submit" class="btn cta__submit">
            提交申请
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <p class="cta__note">不发送营销邮件。仅在你的席位就绪时通知一次。</p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta__body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
    gap: 44px;
    padding: 40px 40px 44px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 80% at 85% 30%, rgba(255, 176, 32, 0.06), transparent 70%),
      var(--steel-850);
  }
  .cta__title {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3.2vw, 34px);
  }
  .cta__sub {
    margin-top: 16px;
    max-width: 48ch;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }
  .cta__list {
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 9px;
  }
  .cta__list li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
  }
  .cta__list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    background: var(--power);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--power);
    clip-path: polygon(50% 0, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0 50%);
  }

  .cta__form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    align-self: center;
  }
  .cta__field {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
  .cta__label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .cta__form input,
  .cta__form select {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--steel-900);
    border: 1px solid var(--steel-600);
    box-shadow: var(--bevel-deep);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }
  .cta__form input::placeholder {
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .cta__form input:focus,
  .cta__form select:focus {
    border-color: var(--power);
    box-shadow: var(--bevel-deep), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255, 176, 32, 0.3);
  }
  .cta__submit {
    margin-top: 4px;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .cta__note {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .cta__body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 26px 22px 30px;
    }
  }
</style>